Blame credits Tomasz Wrona with 358 lines in `src/`, but 295 of them are `src/Generated/TypeMap.php`. Its header says `@generated by bin/generate-types.php, do not edit by hand`, so Tomasz didn't write those lines by hand. I left that file out of the table, and only the 63 hand-written lines count for Tomasz. His "Rename Tool namespace to Support" commit is described as mechanical, so it doesn't show real authorship either.

**`tests/`**

| Author | Lines |
|---|---|
